==Battleground==
*1 [[Large Iron Ball]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Large White Ball]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] (600%) spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Large Red Ball]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Large White Ball]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Large Red Ball]]s (600%) spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Large Iron Ball]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hit Cats]] or [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rusher Cats]] such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] can be used to deal with the Metal Balls.

